  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expanding the local capacity to integrate research, education, and ecotourism into meaningful sea turtle management strategies in Ghana.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will conduct daily night patrols on 10 km of nesting beach within the Muni-Pomadze Ramsar site between November 15, 2014 -February 28 to protect leatherback and olive ridely nests and nesting females; will conduct 20 sea turtle conservation education programs in local communities and weekly radio programs about wildlife conservation; and train 10 community members to conduct sea turtle surveys and ecotourism turle walks.</narrative>
  </description>
